    "Short displayed text is <=28 Unicode codepoints. Map renderer and production manifest are unchanged.",
    "GeoNames PPLX Pest is a scoped exception to the modern capital PPLC selection: independent historic municipality until 1873, then part of modern Budapest. As of this staged report, runtime label resolver does not consume activeIntervals; the historical display rule is pending runtime integration."
